highlights properties accepting that node's type as valid drop targets. The drop was already possible, it just wasn't indicated like it was for other types of properties.\r\n- Custom resources can now be dropped onto array property editors that accept that resource.\r\n- Nodes with a script can now be dropped onto array property editors that accept that type of script.\r\n- Items can be added to an array property by dropping them on the `+ Add Element` button. The button is highlighted to indicate this.\r\n\r\nFurther details and rationale for implementation can be found in the individual commit messages.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6862, which currently has 33 upvotes and no objections.\r\n\r\nCC @YuriSizov who brought this up on Mastodon.\r\n\r\nDemo video:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d61030cc-49f7-4c5a-bef1-79db08e1cf90\r\n\r\nTest project:\r\n\r\n[dragdroptest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18708228/dragdroptest.zip)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/lab